        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin CSD, Modern Square Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Contemporary Square Deadbolt is available in popular finishes like polished chrome, satin nickel, and venetian bronze. Choose from a single cylinder or a double cylinder. This Baldwin Reserve Deadbolt has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 25 year finish warranty. It will fit most pre-drilled doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin Modern Square Rose Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin 5 pin C keyway.</li>\r\n<li>2-1/8\" cross bore and 1\" edge bore for latch.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Tested to exceed ANSI/BHMA Grade 2 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Square Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length: 2-9/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Length: 2-5/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection, Single Cylinder: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection, Double Cylinder: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Standard: 1-3/4\" - 2\" </li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Optional:  1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" or 2\" - 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> Deadbolt is operated by a thumbturn on the interior and a key from the exterior</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> Deadbolt is operated by a key from both the interior and the exterior</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-Contemporary-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354513\" width=\"600\" height=\"124\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin Reserve Finish Options\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Square Deadbolt, Baldwin CSD",
                "description": "Baldwin CSD, Contemporary Square Deadbolt - The Contemporary Square Deadbolt is available in polished chrome, satin nickel, or venetian bronze finishes. Choose from a single cylinder or a double cylinder. This Baldwin Reserve Deadbolt has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 25 year finish warranty. It will fit most pre-drilled doors. \r\n",
                "keywords": "Baldwin Reserve Contemporary Square Deadbolt, BAL-xx.CSD, BAL-CSD, Contemporary Square Deadbolts, Baldwin Square Rose Deadbolts, Baldwin Reserve Collection, contemporary deadbolts, grade 2 deadbolts, modern door locks,  Modern Square Deadbolts, Baldwin Contemporary Square Rose Deadbolts, Modern Door Locks, Baldwin DCCSD150, Baldwin DCCSD260,"
